# Agent-file findings that existed when scripts/ci/agent-files-audit.mjs was added (2026-10-28).
#
# Format: <repo>/<rule>. DEBT, not exemptions. A line may be deleted as soon as the
# finding is gone; a line whose finding is gone does not fail the audit, and a
# finding with no line here does. Add a line only in the PR that decides to.
#
#   no-agents-md / no-rules-block   sync-agent-rules.mjs opens the pull request
#   claude-md-not-a-pointer         fold what is still true into AGENTS.md, leave the pointer
#   home-claude-import-in-*         a rule that lives only on one person's machine is not the repo's
